## Scope note

This MIT license covers the original material in this repository: the Python
scripts under `scripts/` and `src/`, the configuration files under `configs/`,
the tests under `tests/`, and the written reports under `reports/`.

It does NOT cover the following third-party material, which is governed by its
own licenses and is NOT redistributed in this repository:

* **Ultralytics YOLO11** — used as a dependency via its Python API.
  Ultralytics is licensed under AGPL-3.0, with a commercial license available
  from Ultralytics for closed-source use. Users who distribute this project as
  part of a larger work must satisfy the AGPL-3.0 obligations that apply to the
  Ultralytics dependency. See https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  and https://www.ultralytics.com/license.
* **NEU-DET dataset** — not redistributed here. Users must obtain it
  separately under the terms published by its authors. See `README.md`.
* **COCO8 sample dataset** (`datasets/coco8/`) — a smoke-test subset
  distributed by Ultralytics and derived from COCO. Its own LICENSE file is
  retained in that directory.

Model weights (`*.pt`, `*.onnx`) are excluded from this repository via
`.gitignore` and are not covered by this license.
